e real time talk for a second this is  what the plaza looks like and I think  this is from writes in the middle it's  not perfect but this is basically the  idea of what I wanted to get at as you  get into the park this is basically the  site that greets you I also do like how  the curve of the buildings kind of gives  you the impression that it's like kind  of slightly curved camera as well even  though there's definitely not the case  at least that's not how the fov is set  up but yeah this is what it looks like  this is the entrance and it is and it's  more or less finished State at this  point I might get back to it in the  future and touch up some stuff but um  this is just the idea of what I wanted  to do also at some point in a future  when actually get the castle in the  middle of the park you'll see that like  slightly rise up from the back of these  buildings which is one of the reasons  why I wanted to have an arch with like  an opening in the middle of it just so  you can keep your eyes on the wing even  as you get into the pike so um let's get  a better look at some of this stuff I do  have to say I'll get like a real proper  look into all of these things when I get  into like cinematic parts of videos  which is probably gonna come all the way  at the end of this series when I  actually finish it and get a cinematic  video out there but um this is a bit  more of a backstage look as you can see  I have added these backstage buildings  to the things since this is just one  building actually these are just empty  husks of facades even though they kind  of look like real for detailed buildings  they really aren't much in a disney-like  way if you kind of look from the back it  more or less destroys the magic  so this is like one big entrance  building actually which is going to go  into a very small Main Street over here  at least that is the future planning  it's not going to be a very large Main  Street it is going to be a bit  disney-esque with having the Main Street  and the big entrance in all that but it  is going to be a couple of buildings so  already start splitting off the Main  Street just about this point I think so  that we have enough space to have a like  very large walkway over here with a  large lake in the middle of the park  which is what I really want to do so  we'll also have some fun like  interaction between the lake and the  paths in the future which is always cool  and after that Lake or behind the lake I  should say will have the big weenie of  the park which is going to be the castle  which works kind of in a sense like what  a combination almost of the universal  parks and the Disney parks because the  universal islands of adventure of course  has that large lake in the middle of it  and I'm pretty sure Hollywood studios  those too but after that we actually  have a more Disney like well big castle  which will be good to have a large  castle at the end of the Main Street  that sort of thing that you really walk  toward but you also get the fun part of  having the reflection of the castle in  the water and having a cool lake to walk  around in the middle of the park and  that are also more or less be the hub of  the park and then the rest of the path  work is going to be all of the spokes  that go into the different parts  well maybe have the African section over  here but it's probably going to end up  being over here I'm not really sure  about that yet since I wanted to do it  somewhat geographically accurate but  we're already starting with Europe here  and Europe is gonna pretty much cut  through the middle of this park so that  would mean that Africa would get  squished on the side we'll probably get  America over here which will probably  become South America I could maybe  probably get a bit of North America in  there as well but we'll see how that's  gonna work out I don't have any concrete  plans for that or anything  and probably the Asian section over here  which is mostly going t